# shell: desktop
# FS-018/FS-035: a collision now ASKS instead of the shell answering for it.
# Copying a.txt onto a folder that already holds one must stop and put the
# question up, and the answer must reach the engine.
note copy a.txt into sub, which already has one of that name
press 200 97
move 200 90
move 200 77
release 200 77
wait 25
note the job stops with the question up rather than choosing for the user
expect-alert exists
shot /tmp/trk_script/alert.png
note Escape presses Cancel, which abandons the job and destroys nothing
key Escape
wait 15
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/a.txt
quit
